Package: datascan
Title: Scan Data for Quick Structural Summaries and Checks
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: 
    person("Emi", "Tanaka", , "dr.emi.tanaka@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-1455-259X"))
Description: Scans data for checking columns that are constant, one-to-one, missing or all unique. 
 Users can also try to identify the columns that uniquely index the observational unit and whether
 some columns are nested or complete.
